; The independent Machine IR interpreter: synthetic byte-addressed memory with
; per-byte initialization and permissions, its own primitive numeric
; semantics and opcode dispatch, an iterative block dispatcher, helper models
; and the defect taxonomy. It never executes an instruction through the SSA
; interpreter, a source interpreter or a generated kernel. See the Machine IR
; design in .ai/.

